          "lyrics": "Saamaja Vara Gamana Saadhu Hrut Saarasaabja Paala Kaalaateeta Vikhyaata",
          "translation": "O Lord, with the majestic gait of a large elephant! O effulgent sun who causes the hearts of devotees to blossom like the lotus! Lord, your fame transcends time!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
