            "||"
          ],
          "lyrics": "Veda Shiromaatruja Saptasvara Naadaachala Deepa Sveekruta Yaadavakula Murali Vaadana Vinoda Mohanakara Tyaagaraaja Vandaneeya",
          "translation": "You are the divine flame illuminating the subtle and lofty heights of Omkaara, the essence of the Vedas, out of which emanated the seven notes of music. You elevated the Yaadava race; you delighted in playing the flute and fascinated the Gopis by your bewitching form and mellifluous music. You are worshipped by Tyaagaraaja!"
        }
      ]
    }
